==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Lord Enma]] spawns.

==Strategy==
By this point of progression you should have [[Courier Cat]], spamming them along with meatshields will pretty much win the whole stage.

